`,e.jsx(n.p,{children:"Compare taps before/after the effect and on Master; mute the source bus; bypass capture; deliberately stall only the collector until overflow; clear the ring mid-run; pause/resume recording; stop and await export notification, then reopen and count samples. Require independently observed markers and explicit gaps. An overflow invalidates continuous-capture acceptance; an absent callback or empty read remains unknown, not success or silence. Never concatenate separated segments as if time were continuous."}),`
