`,e.jsxs(n.p,{children:["Use ",e.jsx(n.strong,{children:"Rhubarb v1.14.0"}),", whose annotated tag resolves to ",e.jsx(n.strong,{children:"9b9573cd21b253c9ba58739bbd1aa0b50b991bff"}),". The official release was published 2025-04-03; it remained the latest release returned by the official API when checked. The release lists Linux, macOS and Windows ZIPs; only release metadata was inspected, not the binaries or their integrity. Asset digests were null. The pinned workflow targets Windows x64, macos-13 and ubuntu-20.04 builds; do not infer a native Apple Silicon release or all current OS support. Runtime recognizers load local resources from the executable-relative res/sphinx directory; packaging copies language/dictionary and acoustic-model resources there. Keep the distribution resources with the executable. (sources R1–R3)"]}),`
